        "passed": false,
        "reason": "Missing BOM, no service-specific exception handling, blocking I/O inside Flux.create on reactor threads in async service, async demo uses .block() throughout instead of composing reactive chains."
      },
      {
        "name": "Error Handling",
        "passed": false,
        "reason": "Only generic Exception caught in Main. No BlobStorageException handling, no status code inspection, no per-operation error recovery patterns."
      },
      {
        "name": "Code Quality",
        "passed": true,
        "reason": "Code is well-structured with clean separation of concerns (config, sync service, async service, demo). Builder pattern for config is clean. Good documentation in README."
      }
    ]
  },
